{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u6b22\u8fce\u5173\u6ce8\u5e76\u52a0\u5165</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>B\u7ad9\uff1a\u65e7\u662f\u73a9\u513f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u5c0f\u7ea2\u4e66\uff1a\u65e7\u662f\u73a9</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>QQ\u7fa4\uff1a1022200878</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Introduction to \u300aShadow Cocoon<i>\u300b</i> Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00b7Differences between Demo and Full Version</strong><br>The Demo version differs from the official full version of the game, primarily focusing on the core story mainline. It only presents key plot nodes and core gameplay processes, providing players with a clear and concise main experience. In-depth hidden plots and character backgrounds will be revealed in the full version. Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00b7Mainline of This Game Demo</strong><br>Recently, Chen Han, a community police officer, received a complaint from a neighbor in the same residential community about noise from home renovations. His superior assigned him to mediate the issue, so Chen Han set out with a noise detector. During this mission, Chen Han encountered a series of bizarre phenomena beyond normal logic, leaving him perplexed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00b7Introduction to Game Style</strong><br>This game adopts a first-person 3D perspective and PSX retro art style. The story is set in China during the millennium era, with the overall visuals featuring Chinese dreamcore\u2019s nostalgic and psychedelic imagery. This aims to immerse players in a strong sense of nostalgic familiarity and intimacy while they enjoy the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u6e38\u620f\u573a\u666f\u5c55\u793a\uff1a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st